#: scenario8:scenario8_89B80F4D_D25E_472B_A190_7D154859DC46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d83c8ce5562b29a19601f0baa3222e1e3a9a347eb8a8dbbccf94fc723d3e18d
#. default-sha256: 00721eb80ff7849b6af57d22eedd4644f16f047183934abffaf845632a9c47f7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_89B80F4D_D25E_472B_A190_7D154859DC46"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We’re barely holding on as it is, my dear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s not wrong to expect a little "
"remuneration for our services."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Riusciamo a malapena a mantenerci, tesoro mio.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non c’è niente di sbagliato "
"nell’esigere un piccolo pagamento."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BE686E34_D1CA_4A66_98A9_68FA9A2693A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1837b88321389ad41c7c1d3481cc000b6de96032b415b8ba37b5ec23b8ad8b0
#. default-sha256: 08e67919396e75078d93e6c604ce5dab184c4a06cb92756b372121bed85cd5c9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BE686E34_D1CA_4A66_98A9_68FA9A2693A3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No, Mother, it ⟪k:1⟫is⟪k:2⟫ wrong.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Miracles are not to be bartered for."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No, Madre, ⟪k:1⟫è sbagliato⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I miracoli non sono qualcosa da barattare."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E9C03A46_9C08_43BB_BC8E_FE294B256407
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2aada4e0d63df2611d2d8560befb1875b629b680da1b685c4492ebcd6f4d610a
#. default-sha256: e8142dc898da9334a3b2080f118979aadbee9e0a05eb45dfb3803018f0f68e8d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E9C03A46_9C08_43BB_BC8E_FE294B256407"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Listen to me, Morgana...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Every time you give someone a blessing, you’re hurting "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ascoltami, Morgana...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ogni volta che concedi la tua benedizione a qualcuno,⟪k:3⟫fai "
"del male a te stessa."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1913DE84_8D07_4D33_A594_A1969E54BC1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baffca9f5a9a29ba48854f8e53163aa6bf7ed76cdb7336e021efd4869fb24221
